    "title": "NWS confirms EF1 tornado caused damage near Tonganoxie - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Heidi Schmidt ,\n6 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. (KCTV) - The National Weather Service confirms a tornado touched down south of Tonganoxie Monday morning. Surveyors determined the EF1 tornado touched down around 3:30 a.m. and was on the ground for about 50 yards. The tornado began just west of US 24 Highway between Honey Creek Road and Hemphill Road. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
